From: =?UTF-8?q?Lu=C3=ADs=20Duarte?= <lduarte@cloudflare.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 17:17:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Size SVG images from CSS natural dimensions

Retain zero and absent dimensions, normalize the tree viewport to the natural size, and let root style lengths override attributes with the pinned usvg parser.

Co-authored-by: hotty Agent <hotty@neuroplast.io>
---
